    "body": "I would like to exclude `R_RISCV_JAL`, that relocation are used with `j` and `jal`; `j` is used for jump within function and `jal` typically is only used when the target is known very close, otherwise should use `call` or `tail` (then with `R_RISCV_CALL_PLT`).",
